  "comment": "FOURTH PACK, AND THE FIRST WITHOUT AN ALPHABET. Chinese was the test the owner asked for: does the architecture take an ideographic language? Everything held except one thing — every parser assumed the space, and «三加二等于五。» came out as ONE token. The cure is declared, not branched: the pack says how its script separates words, and the segmenter cuts by longest match over what the pack itself declares. A PARADIGM HERE IS NOT INFLECTION BUT CONSTRUCTION — aspect particles and measure words — and that is the honest shape of an isolating language, not a hole in it.",
